      "the event table reduced to a passing network",
      "the network read five ways: centroid, dispersion, radius, core and periphery, motifs, degree",
      "three individual indicators and four team level processes screened against goal difference",
      "one regression over five numbered tables that keeps three variables",
      "the three performance aspects ranked against the other nineteen teams",
      "the same four survivors read as three training recommendations",
      "the four indicators generalized into a teamwork model",
      "strengths, weaknesses, one promotion line and the conclusion"
